Both prototypes are exported in a private header without kernel-doc. Neither function has a user in this patch; the only in-series users are `ctlv_schema_check_blob()` in the next patch and `blob.c` later, so the acquisition user (`blob.c`) comes later, so the commit message claim "shared by schema validation and runtime acquisition" is only true at the end of the series.

